          "summary": "## Continuation Summary\n\n**Objective (stated in model reasoning, item_77810cc9c3564b3a9c987c132bd07d0f):** Find the archived tool output containing the sensor Helios calibration code, after context compaction.\n\n**Facts / evidence**\n- Four historical `read_log` calls were made (tool call IDs old-0, old-1, old-2, old-3; responses item_39ed1edac5cb49c68acb56d381962fc9, item_f7c199380d3940d684a924f8287a2df3, item_c6d656661dd84d5cb0b8cde6b9fb41c7, item_f499172d981b4e74895cf5e32cc38308).\n- Negative results: three of the four log outputs (item_fc2ce3178e1f4424801e80ebe8942ab4, item_524a362f90d244bca03029553ad607d4, item_d1d231188aff43ee997ea4eb9adfb218) each contain only \"Recent unrelated sample; no calibration code here.\" (93 chars each). These items were re-read via `read_context` (calls call_01/02/03; results item_e40d949818a4444f8171078c4c8e787d, item_168bdd5888904967bd5b1602fd828b8d, item_c757f909ade546f4b14651342c6d44df) and confirmed unchanged.\n- Output of old-0 was archived by context compaction (item_cd72684b5c0c4dedb58cf5e8d34467d4) with instruction to recover via `read_context(item_id='item_8418d2f956734182a4207bc47fbf4bbc')`. That item is `item_8418d2f956734182a4207bc47fbf4bbc`, total_chars 34298.\n- `read_context` pages of item_8418d2f956734182a4207bc47fbf4bbc executed successfully (is_error false): offset 0 (item_f9a204f5c81a46d38246118ab42afb10), offset 30000 (item_7a5feaea1754403c953dbbbb23bf1031), offset 15000 (item_0d7415074f544a42a83014659e79ac83), offset 2000 (item_40d11e7506214bfb9037444da3f76145).\n- Key finding: the offset-2000 page contains the literal text \"Sensor Helios exact calibration code: HX-7294-KAPPA\" embedded within long repetitive filler (\"Routine calibration sample; nothing changed.\" / \"Routine sample.\"). This is the calibration code, recovered from the archived item.\n- Content at offsets 0–4000, 2000–6000, 15000–19000, 30000–34000 observed as repetitive filler; page at offset 2000 reported `truncated: true, next_offset: 6000` and next_offset 4000/19000/34000 elsewhere.\n- Preserved item ID referenced by compaction but not shown in this fragment: item_d2ba8476c6614fac8a3f5a2cc65e9961.\n\n**Decisions/reasons**\n- Model chose to page the large archived item at varied offsets to locate real calibration content amid filler (item_eec4c056517d4670bfc2cfe77df9f3f7).\n- Model correctly identified the other three items as irrelevant based on their \"no calibration code here\" content.\n\n**Applied changes / verification**\n- None. Durable state: approvals [], interactions [], tool_operations []. No file changes, no passed tests recorded. The successful `read_context` calls are execution evidence only.\n\n**Unresolved / next actions**\n- The archived item has not been fully enumerated; offsets ~6000–15000, 4000–2000, 19000–30000, and 34000–end were not read. Next action implied by the last response is continuing paging from next_offset 6000 of item_8418d2f956734182a4207bc47fbf4bbc, presumably to confirm no other calibration content. No objective beyond locating the code was stated."
